      text: "## Karmic Chameleon Mastery [HAOKIRU, MASTERY]\nDescription: The essence that binds the universe together is karma; at its most basic form it is the idea that what goes around comes around. Taking that above and beyond, a master of Haokiru can search the souls of their opponent and reveal the most precious secrets to use against them. Such a deep understanding of a mastered technique learned this way disappears after battle, however.\nEffect: At the start of the match, choose an opponent. You are considered to have that opponent's Mastery. Choose one of your opponent's Advanced Attacks. You may use that attack this Match. Choose one of your opponent's Skills. You may use that skill this Match. All of your chosen techniques are considered Haokiru. Any effects referring to Martial Arts Style are considered to refer to Haokiru instead.\nRequirements: You must know at least three (3) Haokiru attacks, skills, and/or blocks.\nTraining Days: 5\n[b]Magumar\nAlpha Collective[/b]\n\n[/list]\n\n[color=#9300C4][big][b][center]Skills[/center][/b][/big][/color][hr]\n\n[color=#9300C4][b][center] 0 Cost[/center][/b][/color]\n[hr]\n[list]",
