      text: "## Channeled Chi Mastery [KIIHAKAI, MASTERY]\nDescription: An intermediate approach to Kiihakai is neither to focus completely on your technique nor your complete destructive capabilities. After all, there is a middle ground and undoubtedly technique is highly important, but not without utilizing the devastating power that a Kiihakai master should have. After all, there is no need to prolong battle. By channeling your chi you can find yourself capable of walking the tightrope between the philosophies and optimize yourself for a quicker battle.\nEffect: You gain +1 Skill slot in your moveset. Your Kiihakai Skills cost -2 KI to a minimum of 1. Your Kiihakai attacks do +(5% Power) for every Kiihakai CONSTANT Skill you have activated.\nRequirements: You must know at least three (3) Kiihakai attacks, skills, and/or blocks.\nTraining Days: 5\n[b]Shi'kir\nNamek[/b]",
